meta {
  name: 04 Payments
  seq: 4
}

docs {
  # Finance → Payments

  The consolidated payment **ledger** behind `/finance/payments` (All / Cash / UPI /
  Bank Transfer / Debit Card / Credit Card / Cancelled / Refunded; Wallet /
  Privilege Card / Loyalty Points are greyed on the FE for this phase).

  Two read endpoints back the page (order + invoice payments merged; status is
  derived — no per-payment status column):

  - **Payment Records** — `GET /finance/payments` (paginated, filtered list).
  - **Payment Summary (KPI Cards)** — `GET /finance/payments/summary` (mode totals + cancelled/refunded).

  Payments are still **written** via the existing flows — order collections through
  the order flow / `POST /payments` (see **46 Order Payments**), invoice receipts
  through `POST /invoices/:id/receive-payment` (see **03 Invoices**). Cancelling a
  ledger row cancels its parent via `PATCH /orders/:id/cancel` or
  `POST /invoices/:id/cancel`.
}
